WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.320 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:51.840 --> 01:55.120
That old lady went to
do laundry with the kids.

01:55.200 --> 01:57.200
They won't be back until dusk.

01:58.640 --> 02:00.480
Plus, she is having a high fever.

02:01.080 --> 02:02.440
She can't get out of bed at all.

02:03.840 --> 02:05.240
You can practically do anything to her.

02:12.080 --> 02:14.560
-Is my gambling debt settled now?
-Get lost!

02:15.840 --> 02:17.640
We have a deal!

02:28.240 --> 02:29.080
Who are you?

02:29.680 --> 02:31.160
I'm your husband.

02:31.240 --> 02:33.360
For once, your gambler
of a father did not lie.

02:33.440 --> 02:35.320
You are in fact a belle.

02:35.400 --> 02:37.160
Today is my lucky day, then.

02:40.640 --> 02:43.160
Somebody! Help!

02:43.240 --> 02:44.600
How could you do this?

02:44.680 --> 02:47.120
Why would you sell your kind daughter off?

02:47.200 --> 02:48.240
-Money!
-Do you know what you're doing?

02:48.320 --> 02:50.680
Whoever pays me 300 coins

02:50.760 --> 02:53.560
gets to be my son-in-law.

02:53.640 --> 02:56.160
300 coins.

02:56.240 --> 02:57.800
-Only 300 coins.
-Have you no conscience?

02:59.280 --> 03:01.920
Be nice. Just give in,
and you won't suffer much.

03:02.520 --> 03:03.520
Understand?

03:14.120 --> 03:15.200
What's happening?

03:16.080 --> 03:16.960
Help!

03:17.560 --> 03:18.400
You wench.

03:18.480 --> 03:21.120
I'll skin you alive.

03:21.200 --> 03:22.440
-I'll sell your sick mother
-Help.

03:22.520 --> 03:24.520
and your sister to the brothel.

03:24.600 --> 03:26.120
They will never to rise again,

03:26.200 --> 03:28.800
trodden underfoot by thousands.

03:35.400 --> 03:38.360
Touch me and you'll wish you were dead.

03:57.520 --> 03:59.320
-It's so quiet in there.
-Suddenly, it's silent.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.400
What is going on?

04:00.480 --> 04:02.000
Can you go in and check?

04:06.720 --> 04:08.320
She's out.

04:08.400 --> 04:09.320
So much blood.

04:09.400 --> 04:10.440
So much blood.

04:10.520 --> 04:12.000
She killed him?

04:16.200 --> 04:17.160
Pa.

04:18.560 --> 04:20.079
Your 300 coins.

04:24.000 --> 04:26.120
-It's a head!
-Oh my!

04:46.280 --> 04:48.760
No, none of them is like her at all.

04:48.840 --> 04:49.880
Take them away.

04:50.480 --> 04:51.440
Move.

04:51.960 --> 04:52.920
Move.

04:53.440 --> 04:54.480
Forgive me.

04:54.560 --> 04:57.760
I told you to find a person,
and this is what you got for me?

04:57.840 --> 04:59.040
Look at them.

04:59.120 --> 05:00.240
None of them is as alluring as Rao.

05:00.320 --> 05:02.560
It's difficult to find
another beautiful woman

05:02.640 --> 05:04.400
like Lady Rao in
the capital on short notice.

05:05.000 --> 05:07.000
I have visited every corner,

05:07.080 --> 05:08.360
and they are the ones
who resemble her the most.

05:08.440 --> 05:11.960
Their eyes or manners
are quite similar to hers.

05:12.040 --> 05:14.720
-Perhaps you can take another look?
-How ridiculous.

05:15.760 --> 05:17.360
You're foolish and blind.

05:17.440 --> 05:19.680
Rao is an unrivaled beauty.

05:19.760 --> 05:21.040
A true gem.

05:21.120 --> 05:23.040
The creatures
you found are nothing like her.

05:23.120 --> 05:24.160
Right, right.

05:24.240 --> 05:25.600
I'll look for more.

05:27.000 --> 05:28.640
Execute her!

05:29.840 --> 05:30.680
‎-Throw it at her.
‎-Stone her to death.

05:30.760 --> 05:32.000
-What is the ruckus?
-Stone her to death.

05:32.080 --> 05:33.880
Acting in self-defense
is enough to acquit her.

05:33.960 --> 05:35.280
Why did they sentence her to death?

05:35.360 --> 05:36.600
-Murderer!
-You're a murderer!

05:36.680 --> 05:38.120
That's unjust.

05:38.200 --> 05:39.360
Justice?

05:39.440 --> 05:41.040
The dead man owned a gambling den.

05:41.120 --> 05:42.840
He was a great bully.

05:42.920 --> 05:47.560
I was told he spent a lot of money
to hire a thug to…

05:47.640 --> 05:48.480
Enough!

05:48.560 --> 05:49.800
-Murderer!
-Poor thing.

05:49.880 --> 05:50.720
-What a tragedy.
-Move aside.

05:50.800 --> 05:52.000
-Don't make things up.
-Don't make things up.

05:52.080 --> 05:53.120
Murderer.

05:53.640 --> 05:54.480
Murderer.

05:54.560 --> 05:55.640
Throw it at her!

05:56.160 --> 05:57.680
Murderer!

05:58.280 --> 06:01.040
-Throw it at her.
-Throw it at her.

06:02.680 --> 06:04.160
Murderer!

06:05.320 --> 06:06.240
Throw it at her.

06:06.760 --> 06:08.640
-Throw it at her.
-Stone her to death.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.000
-Stone her to death.
-Stone her to death.

06:11.080 --> 06:12.400
An eye for an eye.

06:13.160 --> 06:14.640
-Die!
-Go.

06:14.720 --> 06:16.840
Find out the background
of the female prisoner

06:16.920 --> 06:19.000
-and the crime she committed.
-Throw it at her.

06:19.080 --> 06:21.680
-Now!
-Of course.

06:23.720 --> 06:24.560
Murderer.

06:24.640 --> 06:26.480
Luck is on my side.

06:26.560 --> 06:28.280
-You deserve death!
-Throw it at her.

06:28.360 --> 06:31.000
Luck really is on my side.

06:32.360 --> 06:35.360
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

06:38.640 --> 06:39.840
-Hurry, this way.
-Okay.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.280
Why did you kidnap me?

07:15.360 --> 07:18.760
Wash her. Then, I'll take a closer look.

07:19.440 --> 07:21.720
-Yes.
-Come. Quick.

07:22.360 --> 07:23.360
What are you doing?

07:24.240 --> 07:25.080
What are you doing?

07:25.680 --> 07:26.920
What do you want?

07:27.000 --> 07:28.240
Clean her up.

07:28.320 --> 07:29.920
Don't touch me!

07:33.560 --> 07:35.320
You are right, Madam.

07:35.400 --> 07:36.760
According to our law,

07:36.840 --> 07:38.800
women who acted in
self-defense during rape

07:38.880 --> 07:40.320
will be given 40 lashes.

07:40.920 --> 07:42.840
Their family can also pay
a fine in lieu of the sentence.

07:43.720 --> 07:47.040
However, she is poor, so
she was given a death sentence.

07:47.120 --> 07:48.640
I went to the court
office with my name token

07:48.720 --> 07:50.480
and lied that she was my rogue servant.

07:50.560 --> 07:53.040
I claimed that the rapist
was trying to damage our property.

07:53.640 --> 07:56.040
Besides, the Luo family
had moved away overnight.

07:56.720 --> 07:59.320
The magistrate knew
he had meted out an unfair judgment,

07:59.400 --> 08:00.640
so he didn't do much to stop me.

08:00.720 --> 08:04.760
I got her with just a few golden zhus.

08:05.440 --> 08:07.480
Good. You did well.

08:08.760 --> 08:10.880
First Madam, you can't enter.

08:11.400 --> 08:12.440
Madam!

08:14.360 --> 08:16.520
Yufeng, what brought you here?

08:22.000 --> 08:24.520
You brought someone in this late at night.

08:25.040 --> 08:26.840
Is it something you're trying to hide?

08:28.040 --> 08:30.520
Let's speak outside.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.400
We can do it here.

08:54.320 --> 08:57.560
You have always
been very observant, Yufeng.

08:57.640 --> 08:59.440
We can never hide
anything from you in this household.

09:00.440 --> 09:02.160
I never intended to keep this from you.

09:02.240 --> 09:04.640
Allow me to explain.

09:04.720 --> 09:05.840
Spare me.

09:06.520 --> 09:08.920
I know what you're up to.

09:09.920 --> 09:12.720
You ought to know
that the Lus helped found our nation.

09:13.400 --> 09:15.400
They are a prestigious family,

09:15.480 --> 09:18.080
not a family that has fallen from grace.

09:18.160 --> 09:22.480
They will not be puppeteered by anyone.

09:23.080 --> 09:25.720
Your plan is way too bold.

09:26.240 --> 09:27.920
Calm down, Yufeng.

09:28.800 --> 09:29.960
As the saying goes,

09:30.040 --> 09:33.720
only a ruthless man can achieve greatness.

09:33.800 --> 09:36.880
They forced Rao
to marry someone who is as good as dead,

09:36.960 --> 09:38.440
making her a widow for a lifetime.

09:38.960 --> 09:41.240
It's only fair for
us to retaliate in kind.

09:42.160 --> 09:43.560
Among the four sons of the Duke,

09:43.640 --> 09:45.680
three fell on the battlefield.

09:45.760 --> 09:47.760
One is a cripple.

09:47.840 --> 09:50.360
Lu Zhuo is
the only pillar in their family.

09:51.120 --> 09:52.280
With him gone,

09:53.040 --> 09:55.880
the Lu family is just a toothless tiger

09:56.400 --> 09:58.280
whose bite can never hurt.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.920
Don't you agree, Yufeng?

10:13.120 --> 10:15.760
Moreover,
worried that Rao will be affected

10:15.840 --> 10:18.880
by the reputation
of her birth mother, Zhou,

10:19.560 --> 10:21.920
Mother rarely allows
Rao out all these years.

10:22.000 --> 10:23.640
Not many people have seen her.

10:23.720 --> 10:26.440
Besides, the Lu
family is quite preoccupied

10:26.520 --> 10:27.880
with internal and external conflicts.

10:27.960 --> 10:30.680
They have no time to verify her identity.

10:31.280 --> 10:34.920
Once the marital rites
have been carried out,

10:35.000 --> 10:38.640
it'll be too late to change anything.

10:39.800 --> 10:43.440
But what if Lu Zhuo survives?

10:44.920 --> 10:46.080
Impossible.

10:46.160 --> 10:48.880
Seven imperial physicians
in the Imperial Medical Bureau affirm

10:48.960 --> 10:51.400
that he will die soon.

10:52.000 --> 10:58.080
It will take a huge miracle
for him to survive.

10:58.760 --> 11:02.200
Then, after a year or two,
when things have settled down,

11:02.280 --> 11:06.360
we'll marry Rao off somewhere far away
as our adopted daughter.

11:06.440 --> 11:09.400
Now that's better than
being a widow for the rest of her life.

11:11.280 --> 11:13.040
I see.

11:13.120 --> 11:15.000
You've always been stubborn.

11:15.760 --> 11:17.240
I can't talk you out of anything.

11:18.960 --> 11:20.960
Show her to me.

11:21.560 --> 11:23.080
If she doesn't look like her,

11:23.160 --> 11:25.040
your plan will not work anyway.

11:26.760 --> 11:27.600
Bring her out.

11:35.320 --> 11:36.880
Lift your head.

11:53.240 --> 11:54.400
Who are you?

11:54.480 --> 11:55.520
What do you think?

11:55.600 --> 11:59.520
Even you are taken aback, aren't you?

12:01.440 --> 12:04.120
She's as close as one could get.

12:04.720 --> 12:07.240
After we doll her up a little,

12:07.960 --> 12:10.400
no one will be able to tell them apart.

12:15.840 --> 12:17.120
Yufeng.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.480
Are you all right?

12:19.000 --> 12:20.720
You look distraught.

12:21.240 --> 12:22.240
So similar.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.440
So similar.

12:30.480 --> 12:31.480
But

12:32.360 --> 12:34.280
she's a bit too tanned.

12:35.800 --> 12:37.520
Her mannerisms

12:38.600 --> 12:41.240
need to be refined as well.

12:44.800 --> 12:48.320
This chamber is damp and stuffy.
It makes me sick.

12:49.520 --> 12:52.760
I will head back now. Do what you must.

12:53.520 --> 12:54.600
Yufeng,

12:56.680 --> 13:00.600
please don't tell anyone about this.

13:01.200 --> 13:04.200
If Mother finds out,
the plan will fall apart.

13:22.320 --> 13:23.960
A lowly prisoner on death row.

13:24.640 --> 13:25.840
Shouldn't you kneel before me?

13:28.280 --> 13:30.880
Madam, you went out of your way
to save someone on death row.

13:32.280 --> 13:34.320
You certainly need something
important from me.

13:35.040 --> 13:37.000
It is you who seeks a favor.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.080
You should be

13:40.280 --> 13:41.280
the one who kneels.

13:43.880 --> 13:44.840
-Insolent!
-Wait.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.720
I love your audacity.

13:50.320 --> 13:53.560
It seems like I found the right person.

13:55.440 --> 13:56.520
Yes.

13:57.040 --> 13:59.440
I need you to do something for me.

14:01.320 --> 14:02.680
Do it well,

14:03.440 --> 14:06.440
and you'll have a life of wealth.

14:07.720 --> 14:09.200
Fail

14:09.880 --> 14:11.640
and you'll see the guillotine.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.520
In that case,

14:18.040 --> 14:20.760
a life of wealth is a faraway ideal

14:21.440 --> 14:23.080
that I must achieve by risking my life.

14:23.880 --> 14:26.640
I have to do everything,
but I might end up with nothing.

14:27.640 --> 14:28.680
This won't work.

14:29.520 --> 14:32.760
Just send me back to the guillotine.

14:33.360 --> 14:34.320
Wait.

14:34.840 --> 14:35.880
You…

14:37.560 --> 14:39.000
What else do you want?

14:42.000 --> 14:43.160
Madam, you're back.

14:45.080 --> 14:48.600
Madam, what did I do this time?

14:48.680 --> 14:49.720
GOVERNESS CHANG

14:52.280 --> 14:53.440
Search her residence.

14:57.000 --> 15:00.920
Will you give me what I want?

15:04.200 --> 15:05.760
Gold or silver

15:07.960 --> 15:09.200
at your disposal.

15:10.200 --> 15:12.240
You are affluent and powerful.

15:14.080 --> 15:16.600
Something only
a prisoner on death row can do

15:17.400 --> 15:19.080
must be something extremely dangerous.

15:23.240 --> 15:24.560
I want to see my parents

15:25.520 --> 15:28.080
and 50,000 coins.

15:29.280 --> 15:32.360
What? 50,000 coins?

15:33.440 --> 15:35.080
Greedy, aren't you?

15:35.160 --> 15:38.480
50,000 coins is enough
to buy 10 beautiful entertainers.

15:41.520 --> 15:44.000
I'm stupid, clumsy, and can't dance.

15:45.240 --> 15:47.640
Perhaps you can ask
the entertainers to do the job.

15:47.720 --> 15:48.600
You…

15:54.800 --> 15:56.160
Fine.

15:57.080 --> 15:58.880
It's nothing.

15:59.400 --> 16:00.600
You'll have it.

16:01.600 --> 16:02.720
Guards!

16:03.240 --> 16:04.600
Take her away.

16:04.680 --> 16:09.280
Have her properly perfumed.
Get that stink of poverty off her.

16:15.760 --> 16:17.440
I didn't do it, Madam.

16:19.600 --> 16:20.800
Madam.

16:20.880 --> 16:23.280
I didn't do it.

16:23.360 --> 16:26.520
I have served you half my life.

16:26.600 --> 16:29.000
Why won't you trust me?

16:39.320 --> 16:40.600
Madam.

16:41.320 --> 16:45.080
I carry out your orders dutifully.

16:45.160 --> 16:47.640
Some wicked gossip mongers

16:47.720 --> 16:50.280
must have plotted to make you doubt me.

16:50.360 --> 16:51.480
Smash it open.

16:59.240 --> 17:01.960
It was I who poured in

17:02.800 --> 17:06.760
the boiling quick lime back then.

17:07.359 --> 17:10.680
In an instant, the body dissolved.

17:10.760 --> 17:11.599
It was so scary!

17:12.440 --> 17:14.119
If it weren't for this piece of evidence,

17:14.640 --> 17:17.319
I would have died unjustly!

17:26.599 --> 17:28.760
You have followed me for a long time.

17:28.840 --> 17:30.280
Of course, I trust you.

17:31.040 --> 17:32.560
I just need

17:33.360 --> 17:34.840
reassurance.

17:35.600 --> 17:37.040
Thank you, Madam.

17:39.200 --> 17:42.720
Could this just be a coincidence?

17:50.120 --> 17:51.680
Crying? Why are you crying?

17:52.280 --> 17:54.440
We have found ourselves a generous donor.

17:54.520 --> 17:55.760
50,000 coins!

17:56.560 --> 17:58.960
Your flesh and bones

17:59.040 --> 18:00.520
won't even get me 10 coins.

18:02.920 --> 18:04.480
I sold myself to the Wei family.

18:05.040 --> 18:06.440
From now on,
you won't be my parents anymore.

18:07.240 --> 18:09.840
We might not see each other again.

18:11.400 --> 18:14.840
I would like
to speak to Mother in private.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.920
Sure.

18:17.000 --> 18:18.880
Go ahead.

18:18.960 --> 18:20.000
I'll just count my coins.

18:28.160 --> 18:30.200
An indenture is not worth 50,000 coins.

18:30.280 --> 18:32.920
You can't take the money.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.200
Ma.

18:50.880 --> 18:52.000
From now on,

18:52.920 --> 18:54.600
I won't be able to look after you.

18:55.280 --> 18:57.400
Please lead a good life
with my brothers and sisters.

18:58.840 --> 19:00.360
Forget I ever existed.

19:00.440 --> 19:03.560
I don't need it. Keep it for yourself.

19:10.320 --> 19:12.600
We have to be there
before dawn. It's time to go.

19:20.960 --> 19:23.560
It's time to go. Come now.

19:28.920 --> 19:29.760
Go.

19:34.960 --> 19:36.440
Let's go.

19:36.520 --> 19:38.560
They even gave me
a plot of land to manage.

19:38.640 --> 19:40.360
We're going to be rich.

19:40.440 --> 19:44.400
Our daughter is having a comfortable life.
What's there to worry about? Let's go.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.120
My daughter.

19:47.040 --> 19:47.920
My daughter.

19:54.560 --> 19:55.440
My daughter.

20:11.280 --> 20:14.880
FIVE DAYS LATER

20:17.840 --> 20:19.440
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

20:52.120 --> 20:53.520
I am Lu Ya from the Duke's Residence,

20:54.120 --> 20:55.600
here to pick up
the bride on behalf of my brother.

20:55.680 --> 20:56.560
FOWL OF PROSPERITY

20:56.640 --> 20:59.120
Bride, please enter the carriage.

21:01.160 --> 21:03.320
LU YA, ELDEST SON OF
THE SECOND WIFE OF THE DUKE OF YING

21:10.440 --> 21:12.360
Mother, the auspicious hour is upon us.

21:12.960 --> 21:15.080
Time to have Rao
get into the horse carriage.

21:18.080 --> 21:19.560
Wait.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.960
Look. A carriage from Lady Shou'an.

21:23.560 --> 21:24.600
Who is Lady Shou'an?

21:24.680 --> 21:26.920
The distant grandmother of the bride.

21:31.080 --> 21:32.760
I told you not to tell her.

21:32.840 --> 21:33.680
Why did she come?

21:34.360 --> 21:37.080
You think you can hide
everything just because you want to?

21:38.360 --> 21:40.280
LADY SHOU'AN

21:53.000 --> 21:56.040
Old Madam Wei, you sure

21:56.120 --> 21:59.360
have picked a great suitor for Rao.

22:01.360 --> 22:03.960
Do not look around. It is unbecoming.

22:05.520 --> 22:07.040
We should have sent someone to greet you.

22:07.120 --> 22:09.760
Why don't we speak inside?

22:12.320 --> 22:15.040
A coward who's too gutless to do anything.

22:16.040 --> 22:20.080
What? Afraid that others
would think you sell your niece off

22:20.160 --> 22:21.560
to please the Duke?

22:22.520 --> 22:24.880
Or do you fear the pointing fingers

22:24.960 --> 22:26.880
that you can't even
protect the only daughter

22:26.960 --> 22:28.000
of your younger brother?

22:28.600 --> 22:30.880
The marriage between
both families has long been arranged.

22:30.960 --> 22:34.080
The heir to the Duke of Ying is handsome

22:34.160 --> 22:36.040
and is a protector of the nation.

22:36.120 --> 22:40.520
If my granddaughter can bring them
peace and prosperity,

22:40.600 --> 22:42.840
or even cure my grandson-in-law,

22:43.520 --> 22:45.080
that's her honor.

22:47.360 --> 22:48.640
Do not interrupt us.

23:00.560 --> 23:02.080
Mother had to make difficult decisions.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.880
Lady Shou'an, you accused her wrongly

23:03.960 --> 23:05.320
without knowing the full story.

23:05.400 --> 23:07.960
We are part of a bigger family.

23:08.040 --> 23:09.560
Lest the outsiders gossip about us,

23:10.320 --> 23:13.520
I invite you to talk in
private inside the house.

23:14.320 --> 23:15.640
No need.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.960
We are no longer a family.

23:18.040 --> 23:21.480
I came here today
to give my granddaughter some gifts.

23:27.440 --> 23:29.160
As per His Majesty's decree,

23:29.240 --> 23:30.840
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

23:30.920 --> 23:33.280
"Lu Zhuo, the heir to the Duke of Ying,

23:33.360 --> 23:36.480
is a valiant warrior

23:36.560 --> 23:39.160
who has protected
our society from invaders.

23:39.760 --> 23:42.000
The daughter of the Earl of Cheng'an

23:42.080 --> 23:45.040
is a prestigious woman of virtues

23:45.120 --> 23:48.440
and embodies the morals of feminine codes.

23:49.200 --> 23:53.440
To extend my well wishes
for their eternal union,

23:54.040 --> 23:57.320
the bride shall be bestowed
a set of golden crowns and hairpins,

23:57.400 --> 23:59.320
and one crimson ritual garment.

23:59.920 --> 24:02.320
These gifts will exalt
the bride's virtue and worthiness

24:02.400 --> 24:05.400
and honor the loyalty of
our valiant defender of the realm."

24:06.480 --> 24:09.000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

24:15.960 --> 24:17.480
It is indeed a golden crown.

24:18.080 --> 24:19.080
No one can wear it

24:19.160 --> 24:21.760
except for the Empress Dowager,
the Empress, and the consorts.

24:21.840 --> 24:24.840
So someone in the palace
is voicing support for the daughter.

24:25.440 --> 24:27.600
Wear the crown and lift the fan!

24:27.680 --> 24:28.920
Please don't do it!

24:30.560 --> 24:32.240
Greetings, Lady Shou'an.

24:32.760 --> 24:33.920
I believe the groom

24:34.680 --> 24:37.440
should be the one to remove the fan.

24:39.160 --> 24:42.720
Him? He's in bed, unconscious.

24:42.800 --> 24:43.640
How can he lift the fan?

24:44.760 --> 24:45.760
Just back off.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.920
You're worried it's bad luck too, right?

25:07.200 --> 25:11.160
Fine. I won't remove your fan.

25:11.880 --> 25:13.160
I'll walk you to the carriage.

25:20.920 --> 25:22.120
Grandmother.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.120
Good girl.

25:42.760 --> 25:43.640
Wei Rao.

25:44.360 --> 25:47.240
You're so lucky to have grandparents

25:47.320 --> 25:48.760
who care so much about you.

25:49.400 --> 25:52.720
Allow me to repay their kindness
on your behalf.

26:06.040 --> 26:10.000
MAY JOY ALWAYS FIND YOU
MAY WE NEVER BE FORGOTTEN TO EACH OTHER

26:18.760 --> 26:20.840
The Weis and the Lus have
long had a marital arrangement.

26:21.480 --> 26:23.440
The groom is heavily injured and
needs a celebration to turn his luck over.

26:24.240 --> 26:28.120
That said, Wei Rao has given her heart
to her childhood playmate and cousin.

26:28.200 --> 26:30.560
She refuses to marry into the Lu family.

26:30.640 --> 26:32.480
I bought you for 50,000 coins.

26:32.560 --> 26:35.360
If Lu Zhuo lives,
you can enjoy a comfortable life.

26:35.440 --> 26:39.000
If he dies, you'll deal
with the hardship alone.

26:39.080 --> 26:43.320
From now on, fate will decide your life.
You have no one to blame.

26:43.400 --> 26:44.320
A-Chou,

26:46.000 --> 26:47.360
from now on,

26:48.040 --> 26:50.520
you are Lady Wei Rao,

26:50.600 --> 26:52.760
the new bride of
the Duke of Ying's family.

26:56.320 --> 26:59.840
You are Wei Rao.

27:08.800 --> 27:10.240
What are you doing?

27:10.320 --> 27:11.320
Come in here.

27:17.960 --> 27:19.560
How dare you?

27:19.640 --> 27:22.120
If someone recognizes you,
our plan will be ruined.

27:22.200 --> 27:23.480
She is wearing my golden crown!

27:24.880 --> 27:26.800
And she is the new bride
of the Duke of Ying's family.

27:26.880 --> 27:30.320
But I have to hide myself from everyone.

27:31.160 --> 27:32.120
It's so unfair.

27:33.200 --> 27:36.320
A lowly woman gets to enjoy nobility

27:36.840 --> 27:38.840
and a life of abundance for nothing.

27:38.920 --> 27:42.400
Everything in this life
comes with a price.

27:43.240 --> 27:46.920
The heir was seriously injured
while he served our nation.

27:47.760 --> 27:51.200
The bride
comes from a miserable background.

27:52.560 --> 27:56.040
Instead of turning the luck around,
she might worsen it.

27:56.120 --> 27:59.320
Then, in grief and sorrow,

27:59.400 --> 28:03.000
she might follow her husband's
footsteps by hanging herself.

28:03.600 --> 28:05.280
That's normal, isn't it?

28:05.960 --> 28:07.120
In the end,

28:07.200 --> 28:10.240
it makes our family look good.

28:11.400 --> 28:13.120
So you already have a plan, Aunt?

28:13.200 --> 28:14.600
I do everything for you.

28:15.200 --> 28:17.240
Of course, I know what you want.

28:17.840 --> 28:19.160
You're not one

28:20.120 --> 28:23.320
to allow others to
take your spot and glory.

28:32.120 --> 28:33.120
However,

28:33.800 --> 28:36.280
you must bear with me for the moment.

28:36.800 --> 28:38.920
There are many eyes back home.

28:39.440 --> 28:42.320
You should stay in
our secondary residence for now.

28:43.040 --> 28:45.800
In case of over hearing,

28:46.320 --> 28:48.480
when you go out, don't go by the name Rao.

28:50.080 --> 28:51.920
What should I call myself then?

28:56.880 --> 28:57.720
Jundai.

28:59.000 --> 29:00.240
Jundai it is.

29:01.240 --> 29:02.720
Jundai.

29:05.960 --> 29:07.800
I like the sound of it.

29:07.880 --> 29:09.760
I can't wait to see

29:10.960 --> 29:13.840
how that lowly woman will fare.

29:16.080 --> 29:18.800
FIVE DAYS AGO

29:25.400 --> 29:27.640
HONGXIAN, A-CHOU'S YOUNGER SISTER

29:33.520 --> 29:35.680
Ma, I need to use the toilet.

29:36.640 --> 29:37.680
Me too.

29:37.760 --> 29:38.600
RUNSHENG, A-CHOU'S YOUNGER BROTHER

29:38.680 --> 29:39.960
Halt!

29:41.560 --> 29:43.160
My daughter needs to use the loo.

29:43.240 --> 29:44.760
Can we stop in front?

29:45.600 --> 29:47.600
Besides, it's quite warm.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.600
You two can rest and have some cold tea.

29:49.680 --> 29:50.760
It won't take too long.

29:51.560 --> 29:53.000
Come. Halt.

30:02.000 --> 30:03.000
Over here.

30:14.640 --> 30:16.320
Superintendent Jin, have some tea.

30:17.520 --> 30:18.520
Here you go.

30:18.600 --> 30:19.720
Thanks.

30:36.920 --> 30:39.520
Ma, at night, sleep with one eye open.

30:40.240 --> 30:41.960
If the journey leads to somewhere
more and more remote,

30:42.480 --> 30:44.000
they might be up to something.

30:45.560 --> 30:48.480
Your asthma medicine
contains henbane flower.

30:49.000 --> 30:50.720
It has a soporific effect.

30:51.440 --> 30:54.440
Mix it with tea
and feed it to the coachmen.

30:55.280 --> 30:56.320
Let's go.

31:13.720 --> 31:14.560
Let's go.

31:28.600 --> 31:30.160
Wake up. Those three ran away.

31:30.840 --> 31:32.560
Who? Who ran away?

31:33.400 --> 31:34.480
It's almost dawn.

31:35.160 --> 31:36.040
It's too late.

31:36.640 --> 31:37.800
Get rid of the guy first.

31:37.880 --> 31:39.920
We'll bury him in
the woods and report back.

31:40.000 --> 31:41.600
Don't tell anyone about this.

31:43.200 --> 31:45.280
Think you can get 50,000 coins for free?

31:45.360 --> 31:47.160
That's the worth of your entire family.

31:52.880 --> 31:56.480
SONGYUE HALL, DUKE'S RESIDENCE

32:08.080 --> 32:09.520
So, he is Lu Zhuo.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.040
The heir is sick.

32:15.120 --> 32:16.840
The marital rites had to be simplified.

32:16.920 --> 32:17.800
I hope you don't mind.

32:18.840 --> 32:21.600
Old Madam is afraid that having
his mother here will only upset her.

32:21.680 --> 32:23.800
So she is receiving guests
at the banquet hall now.

32:23.880 --> 32:25.400
But Old Madam is also
aware that it's your first time here,

32:25.480 --> 32:27.080
so she asks me to keep you company here.

32:27.160 --> 32:29.720
You may let me know if you need anything.

32:29.800 --> 32:30.640
KONG YINGSHU
FOURTH DAUGHTER-IN-LAW AT DUKE'S RESIDENCE

32:30.720 --> 32:32.160
I am the heir's Fourth Aunt.

32:32.880 --> 32:34.160
Greetings, Fourth Aunt.

32:35.360 --> 32:37.600
It is warm tonight.

32:37.680 --> 32:38.760
Why are you wearing gloves?

32:52.320 --> 32:54.080
I was careless in my needlework

32:54.600 --> 32:56.960
and pricked myself while
I was getting ready for the marriage.

32:57.040 --> 32:58.680
My hands are full of scars.

32:58.760 --> 33:00.040
I am embarrassed to show them.

33:00.640 --> 33:01.880
That's why I wear gloves.

33:03.240 --> 33:04.560
I see.

33:05.160 --> 33:07.080
I was told that your name is Rao.

33:07.160 --> 33:08.520
I shall call you Rao then.

33:09.440 --> 33:10.840
Lu Zhuo is still unconscious.

33:10.920 --> 33:13.320
Allow me to lift
the fan veil on his behalf.

33:14.280 --> 33:15.560
Thank you, Fourth Aunt.

33:24.720 --> 33:25.760
Oh my.

33:25.840 --> 33:27.320
You're so pretty.

33:27.400 --> 33:31.120
They say a beautiful woman can turn
a cold cell into a gilded hall.

33:31.920 --> 33:34.440
Seeing what you look like now,

33:34.520 --> 33:38.320
even a gilded hall
cannot outshine your charm.

33:43.480 --> 33:47.720
Unfortunately,
the heir won't see it tonight.

33:50.800 --> 33:52.960
It's all right, Fourth Aunt.

33:53.040 --> 33:54.800
The heir is a blessed man.

33:54.880 --> 33:56.000
He will recover one day.

33:56.760 --> 33:58.560
I hope he wakes up soon.

33:58.640 --> 34:02.880
He will be over the moon when he sees
how beautiful his wife is.

34:04.120 --> 34:05.480
Oh, Governess Miao.

34:07.280 --> 34:08.719
Greetings, Madam.

34:09.239 --> 34:12.000
This is Governess Miao,
Mother's confidant.

34:12.080 --> 34:14.320
If you ever need anything,

34:14.400 --> 34:18.560
or if your servant is disrespecting you,
just go to her.

34:23.440 --> 34:26.360
Someone sent by the Duchess?

34:26.440 --> 34:28.600
She's clearly here to
take over Songyue Hall.

34:28.679 --> 34:30.920
Grandmother sure
has thought of everything.

34:31.880 --> 34:33.600
The heir is sick,

34:33.679 --> 34:34.960
and I'm young and inexperienced.

34:36.199 --> 34:38.080
I shall learn from you, Governess Miao.

34:38.159 --> 34:40.000
Once I'm familiar with everything,

34:40.080 --> 34:41.400
I'll care for the heir myself,

34:42.000 --> 34:43.880
that Governess may be spared the hardship.

34:44.800 --> 34:48.159
I will do my best to assist you, Madam.

34:48.239 --> 34:50.360
They are all aware of Lu Zhuo's condition,

34:50.440 --> 34:52.159
so they won't disturb you tonight.

34:52.800 --> 34:54.800
You have had an eventful day,
so you must be tired.

34:54.880 --> 34:55.719
Rest now.

34:56.320 --> 34:58.440
You can
greet the elderly tomorrow morning.

34:59.000 --> 34:59.840
I shall take my leave now.

35:01.400 --> 35:02.600
Take care, Fourth Aunt.

35:09.040 --> 35:09.920
Madam,

35:10.440 --> 35:13.960
allow me to lead
your servants to settle down.

35:14.480 --> 35:16.480
No need for that.

35:16.560 --> 35:18.520
Madam is used to my and Bitao's service.

35:18.600 --> 35:19.440
GOVERNESS WU

35:19.520 --> 35:21.480
We cannot be away from her.

36:12.800 --> 36:15.880
Thanks to your quick wit, Madam.
You had already prepared your answer

36:15.960 --> 36:17.480
and cleared Fourth Madam's doubts.

36:18.000 --> 36:21.120
This almond whitening ointment
can rejuvenate skin.

36:21.640 --> 36:25.360
In a fortnight,
your hands will be smooth and spotless.

36:27.200 --> 36:28.880
How is that enough?

36:28.960 --> 36:31.520
You have done hard labor.

36:31.600 --> 36:34.560
You're nothing like a noble lady.

36:34.640 --> 36:36.600
Since it's your first time
in a prestigious family,

36:36.680 --> 36:38.480
there are many rules you don't know.

36:38.560 --> 36:40.000
Keep your mouth shut if you can.

36:40.760 --> 36:42.800
I can be your messenger.

36:42.880 --> 36:44.600
Speak more, and you might slip up.

36:44.680 --> 36:46.400
And if you slip up,

36:46.480 --> 36:48.160
the Earl's reputation will be ruined,

36:48.760 --> 36:51.160
even we servants would get dragged down.

36:51.760 --> 36:55.600
That Governess Miao
is obviously an informant planted here.

36:56.640 --> 36:58.320
You have a special identity.

36:58.400 --> 37:00.480
Having outsiders here
will just add unnecessary risks.

37:00.560 --> 37:02.760
You should remove them
as soon as possible.

37:03.360 --> 37:05.280
Seems to me you're the informant.

37:07.200 --> 37:08.040
I've grown weary.

37:09.000 --> 37:10.240
We can talk tomorrow.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.760
Governess Wu, stay here.

37:12.840 --> 37:14.360
Attend the patient for his needs.

37:14.440 --> 37:15.680
What?

37:15.760 --> 37:18.000
First Madam assigned me here

37:18.080 --> 37:20.520
to teach you how to run a household
and how to act like a lady.

37:20.600 --> 37:23.880
I… There's no way I can tend to the sick.

37:25.840 --> 37:27.400
If you can't handle such a small thing,

37:28.520 --> 37:30.320
don't stand there then.

37:30.400 --> 37:31.560
Find someone who can.

37:32.160 --> 37:33.640
I… You…

37:37.800 --> 37:41.080
I will do as Madam says.
I shall take my leave now.

37:41.160 --> 37:45.360
BLISS

37:47.320 --> 37:49.400
Bitao, prepare me for bed.

37:53.240 --> 37:54.200
Is that how you say it?

37:55.360 --> 37:57.080
Yes, My Lady. You're so smart.

38:42.680 --> 38:45.320
It seems like fate hates you.

38:45.400 --> 38:47.040
It turns you into a living corpse,

38:48.320 --> 38:52.040
and even gives you
a night soil collector as your wife.

38:54.880 --> 38:56.360
A poor woman from a humble family

38:56.880 --> 38:59.120
and a noble gentleman.

39:00.000 --> 39:01.320
It feels like a dream.

39:07.440 --> 39:09.120
I've spent five days
practicing the etiquette.

39:09.760 --> 39:11.320
I cannot afford to slip up.

39:17.480 --> 39:18.600
Lord Lu.

39:19.320 --> 39:21.040
You are handsome,

39:21.120 --> 39:24.360
but you are gravely ill and emaciated.

39:24.880 --> 39:26.320
It makes you less attractive.

39:28.480 --> 39:31.160
Please turn around,
for your face might frighten me at night.

39:32.800 --> 39:35.440
I know you can't move. Let me

39:36.120 --> 39:37.400
help you.

40:45.520 --> 40:47.520
You want to break off our engagement?

40:48.280 --> 40:50.120
In your dreams.

40:50.200 --> 40:52.520
You say I'm as venomous as a snake?

40:52.600 --> 40:53.440
How pitiful.

40:54.040 --> 40:56.600
You are destined to share a bed with one,

40:56.680 --> 41:00.200
and you'll never escape
me for as long as you live.

41:17.960 --> 41:19.240
You're awake?

41:20.400 --> 41:21.640
Get away from me.

41:22.360 --> 41:23.360
What?

41:24.920 --> 41:26.160
Get away from my bed.

41:32.800 --> 41:33.680
Someone!

41:34.560 --> 41:36.840
Someone! The heir is awake!

41:37.680 --> 41:38.960
Someone!

41:39.040 --> 41:41.440
The heir is awake! Someone!

41:42.240 --> 41:43.560
-His Lordship.
-His Lordship.

41:46.640 --> 41:48.000
Quick.

41:48.080 --> 41:51.480
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

41:51.560 --> 41:54.840
-His Lordship is awake.
-His Lordship is awake.

41:55.400 --> 41:56.600
How wonderful.

42:24.760 --> 42:26.960
Does Lu Zhuo
hold any grudges against Wei Rao?

42:27.680 --> 42:29.200
He looks at me as if I were a beast.

42:30.840 --> 42:33.520
His Lordship's pulse is steady.
He is in good health.

42:33.600 --> 42:35.680
He is one lucky soul.

42:36.200 --> 42:37.920
However, he still needs to convalesce.

42:38.000 --> 42:39.080
All right.

42:39.160 --> 42:41.480
He woke up. Let's speak outside.

42:42.440 --> 42:43.440
Great news.

42:45.280 --> 42:46.120
Come, Physician Zhao.

42:52.520 --> 42:55.520
The toxin is still inside him,
but he is no longer in danger.

42:56.400 --> 42:58.480
His Lordship just needs to rest.

42:58.560 --> 43:00.200
I'll write up
a medicinal diet prescription.

43:00.280 --> 43:02.240
His Lordship hasn't eaten for a long time.

43:02.320 --> 43:05.320
He needs to have many small meals
over the day to regain his vigor.

43:06.080 --> 43:09.440
Once he is nourished,
his body will become strong again.

43:09.520 --> 43:12.360
The residual toxin will not hurt him.

43:12.440 --> 43:16.200
Physician Zhao,
you have saved my grandson.

43:16.720 --> 43:19.360
Once Lu Zhuo makes a full recovery,
I'll have him thank you in person.

43:20.080 --> 43:21.520
Governess Miao, please see him off.

43:22.880 --> 43:24.120
Farewell.

43:24.200 --> 43:25.880
How great.

43:25.960 --> 43:28.560
Zhuo finally woke up.

43:29.320 --> 43:33.000
This feels like a dream.

43:34.960 --> 43:36.160
Young child,

43:36.800 --> 43:38.360
it's all thanks to you.

43:38.960 --> 43:39.800
Back then,

43:39.880 --> 43:42.520
Lu Zhuo had fallen into a coma
for days without any sign of waking.

43:43.120 --> 43:45.240
Even the imperial physicians were stumped.

43:45.320 --> 43:47.880
I had no choice

43:47.960 --> 43:50.560
but to beg for a marriage
to turn over his luck.

43:51.480 --> 43:52.520
Given the circumstances,

43:52.600 --> 43:55.480
no one wanted to marry
their daughter off like that.

43:55.560 --> 43:57.200
But Old Madam Wei

43:57.280 --> 44:00.160
was kind enough.
She learned of our hardship,

44:00.240 --> 44:03.000
and you're generous enough
to agree to this marriage.

44:03.920 --> 44:07.640
I will always remember
this kindness from you.

44:08.440 --> 44:10.480
Yes, Rao.

44:10.560 --> 44:12.280
You are a blessing to the Lu family.

44:13.040 --> 44:16.160
Lu Zhuo will treat you with love and care.

44:16.240 --> 44:18.240
He will repay your favor.

44:18.840 --> 44:21.000
His Lordship is blessed by the gods.

44:21.080 --> 44:22.640
It is not my doing at all.

44:23.240 --> 44:24.680
However, His Lordship just woke up.

44:24.760 --> 44:25.960
He is quite weak now.

44:26.040 --> 44:28.600
Why don't all of you rest now?

44:29.280 --> 44:31.120
I shall look after His Lordship.

44:31.200 --> 44:33.040
Under the guidance of Governess Miao,

44:33.560 --> 44:34.920
I'm sure nothing will go wrong.

44:35.680 --> 44:36.800
Sure.

44:36.880 --> 44:41.920
Anyway, we can always talk
once Lu Zhuo makes a full recovery. Come.

44:42.000 --> 44:43.360
Thank you so much.

44:43.440 --> 44:44.520
Let's go.

44:50.000 --> 44:51.440
Farewell.

45:28.560 --> 45:31.720
Turning over my luck? That's nonsense.

45:32.520 --> 45:34.120
I woke up

45:38.000 --> 45:39.840
because it's not my time to die yet.

45:40.640 --> 45:41.880
As to you,

45:42.600 --> 45:44.280
you venomous, treacherous woman.

45:44.360 --> 45:46.520
Who are you after this time?

45:50.160 --> 45:51.240
Jiede.

45:52.440 --> 45:53.600
Jiede.

45:58.400 --> 45:59.560
Your Lordship.

46:00.160 --> 46:01.440
Bring my servant here.

46:05.320 --> 46:07.120
Now!

46:11.160 --> 46:14.440
Compared to Your Lordship's thoroughness,
I sure am short-sighted.

46:15.600 --> 46:16.440
Bitao,

46:16.960 --> 46:18.080
His Lordship will often need to see

46:18.160 --> 46:20.000
the physician and the male servants.

46:20.080 --> 46:21.280
The female servants in
the rear court will be an inconvenience.

46:22.040 --> 46:24.600
Therefore, he will move
to the study to recuperate.

46:24.680 --> 46:27.480
Inform Governess Miao of that decision
and tell her to inform Old Madam as well.

46:27.560 --> 46:29.760
Then, tell Jiede in the study
in the front court

46:29.840 --> 46:33.080
to bring several attentive helpers
with him tomorrow morning.

46:34.040 --> 46:35.080
Yes.

46:46.000 --> 46:47.960
Old Madam and Mother prayed so hard

46:48.880 --> 46:50.040
for you to wake up.

46:50.120 --> 46:52.720
Your Lordship, it is imperative
that you take good care of yourself.

46:52.800 --> 46:54.080
Avoid emotional outbursts

46:54.680 --> 46:56.440
lest the elderly worry about you.

46:56.520 --> 46:57.960
You don't want to be unfilial, do you?

46:58.720 --> 47:00.800
Not only are you a venomous snake,

47:01.320 --> 47:03.080
you are also a hypocritical snake

47:03.960 --> 47:06.200
with a silver tongue.

47:07.240 --> 47:08.200
Get away from me!

49:22.480 --> 49:24.400
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
